(text "05 / ALWAYS-ON MCU AND INDICATORS" (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "7ac97034-7f04-5c4c-9675-293acd455462"))
(text "Programming REQUIRED. Default firmware denies the main stage until qualification.\nSteady = healthy; 4 Hz affected-rail fault; actual missing PD9 = synchronous 0.5 Hz all LEDs.\nRUN open / general FLT / insufficient current are NOT labelled missing PD." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left)) (uuid "41d932fe-6893-5eae-942d-40787e79bfac"))
(text "LED supply is ALWAYS AUX3V3, never the monitored rail.\n1k resistors R32..R34: Basic 0603; schematic provision only.\nD10/D11/D12: standard RED 3mm formed leads, manual JLC exclusion." (at 205.74 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "417fe5b5-cd80-5cba-abad-6f53223ef7ec"))
(text "PB3 pin8 = independent bipolar enable (default pulldown R40).\nPA5 pin3 spare; use internal 2.5 V ADC reference, calibrate before power." (at 20.32 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "23b4094a-7a29-5055-88f5-8acac73455a9"))
